A||||11||FieroKyle||Lansing Meet Pics from September (Nascho & Phool)||||1||
Z||000000||FieroKyle||12-16-2001||11:30 PM||||Alright, these are the few pics I took at the meet. It happened in mid-September and sadly turned unsuccessful due to no one showing up because of the rain-factor that day. But the true die-hard Fiero fans did show up.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> We ended up just hanging out for a while and when it started to downpour, headed to McDonalds for dinner. On the way there this old lady in a Caddy about ran me off the road which pissed me off royally since I had just got my car back from the bodyshop. Anyways heres the few pics.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LansingMeet.jpg"> <P>Two is a pic of all the cars, ( <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">) then the one is me and Phool flying down the expressway at 90 to 100 mph going back to Grand Rapids. It turned out to be pretty fun. Have to do it again just with more people. At this rate of winter I will have the Fiero on the road in February, lol. This is has been a mild Michigan winter, too bad I put the car up 2 months ago.<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fierokylesig_1.gif">      <P>My Fast 'n Black Car<BR>Kyle - 85' GT||||reg||1
Z||000001||MooCow||12-17-2001||12:42 AM||||Sorry I wasn't able to make it.  Wanted to meet all of you, but my car wasn't feeline well  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">   O well next time I will show up with or without my Fiero.  <P><BR>Thanks Ken<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/forum_pic.jpg">  <BR>AOL=MooCow888||||reg||10
Z||000002||pHoOl||12-17-2001||01:40 AM||||Sweet pics!!!  Either that shot of me is kinda crooked, or i must have been accelerating hard (i'm guessing it's the first).  But i'm amazed at how well the pic came out.  Look at the trees... considering we were doing prolly 90 or something (hi dad!) they look darn good.  Disposable camaras are getting pretty good!<P>------------------<BR>Kills:<BR>97 Neon R/T<P>AIM: phool88fiero<P>         <IMG SRC="http://www.gvsuphool.homestead.com/files/phoolsig2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000003||ChopTop||12-17-2001||09:14 AM||||I was there!!!! Hung out for awhile but thought no one was coming because it was raining so I headed back home, not bad since I live close by.  Hopefully we can have a spring get-together.  ||||reg||1
Z||000004||FieroJoe||12-17-2001||10:43 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by ChopTop:<BR><B>I was there!!!! Hung out for awhile but thought no one was coming because it was raining so I headed back home, not bad since I live close by.  Hopefully we can have a spring get-together.  </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>We, FieroMaster88, myself, and Black86SE were going to come, but then we found out that neither MooCow, jch82, or Tigger would be there so we didnt want to be the only ones.  Also, we had a bunch of stuff to fix on all our Fieros.  Too bad we didnt get done quicker and we would have tried to make it there.<P>We are planning for a huge get together of MI forum members, (all others invited, of course!) in the spring.  Hoping for 20+ Fieros!||||reg||1
Z||000005||FieroKyleatSchool||12-17-2001||12:03 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by pHoOl:<BR><B>Sweet pics!!!  Either that shot of me is kinda crooked, or i must have been accelerating hard (i'm guessing it's the first).  But i'm amazed at how well the pic came out.  Look at the trees... considering we were doing prolly 90 or something (hi dad!) they look darn good.  Disposable camaras are getting pretty good!<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>Well, could be accelerating or, the fact I was driving and taking the picture at the same time while doing 90+. Didn't have a lot of time to take it. Lol  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>||||reg||1
