Z||000010||FieroKyleatSchool||12-17-2001||02:33 PM||||I was trying to get my friend with an 86' SE 2m4 to go but he had plans with his g/f. I brought another friend. Might not bring him next time, he had his fly open almost the whole time. Sort of funny. Probably next time I can get friend with the 86 SE to come out with me. He like Fieros just about (just about  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">) as much as me. He doesn't know a ton about them, but does know decent general knowledge on them. Anyways, might have to get something planned for an April Meet or March. I don't plan getting the Fiero out atleast till late March. Its all nice in a garage safe from trucks, trees, and deer.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fierokylesig_1.gif">          <P>PFF Name while I am at school screwing around in Computer class. =)<P>My Fast n' Black car.<BR>Kyle - 85' GT||||reg||1
